{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_8_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_8","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_8_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_8","textTraditional":"八年春，宋公、衛侯遇于垂。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_8_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_8","textTraditional":"三月，鄭伯使宛來歸祊。庚寅，我入祊。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_8_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_8","textTraditional":"夏六月己亥，蔡侯考父卒。辛亥，宿男卒。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_8_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_8","textTraditional":"秋七月庚午，宋公、齊侯、衛侯盟于瓦屋。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_8_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_8","textTraditional":"八月，葬蔡宣公。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_8_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_8","textTraditional":"九月辛卯，公及莒人盟于浮來。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_8_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_8","textTraditional":"螟。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_8_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_8","textTraditional":"冬十有二月，無駭卒。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_8_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_8","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_8_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_8","textTraditional":"八年春，齊侯將平宋、衛，有會期。宋公以幣請於衛，請先相見，衛侯許之，故遇于犬丘。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_8_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_8","textTraditional":"鄭伯請釋泰山之祀而祀周公，以泰山之祊易許田。三月，鄭伯使宛來歸祊，不祀泰山也。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_ttr_8_13","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_8","textTraditional":"夏，虢公忌父始作卿士于周。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_ttr_8_14","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_8","textTraditional":"四月甲辰，鄭公子忽如陳逆婦媯。辛亥，以媯氏歸。甲寅，入于鄭。陳鍼子送女。先配而後祖。鍼子曰：「是不為夫婦。誣其祖矣，非禮也，何以能育？」","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_ttr_8_15","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_8","textTraditional":"齊人卒平宋、衛于鄭。秋，會于溫，盟于瓦屋，以釋東門之役，禮也。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_ttr_8_16","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_8","textTraditional":"八月丙戌，鄭伯以齊人朝王，禮也。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_ttr_8_17","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_8","textTraditional":"公及莒人盟于浮來，以成紀好也。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_ttr_8_18","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_8","textTraditional":"冬，齊侯使來告成三國。公使眾仲對曰：「君釋三國之圖，以鳩其民，君之惠也。寡君聞命矣，敢不承受君之明德。」","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_ttr_8_19","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_8","textTraditional":"無駭卒。羽父請謚與族。公問族於眾仲。眾仲對曰：「天子建德，因生以賜姓，胙之土而命之氏。諸侯以字為謚，因以為族。官有世功，則有官族，邑亦如之。」公命以字為展氏。","sentenceOrder":19}],"overrides":{}}